          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "PRODUCE_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1765003712542",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765003712543_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Give one sentence on asking user to select a Product. Then give a second sentence on stating that the below products can be targeted for Cross Sell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_MARKETING_MARKETINGCOMMONDATA",
            "functionName": "getProducts",
            "name": "Product BO Node 1"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765004773987"
          },
          "code": "PRODUCT_BO_NODE_1",
          "id": "1765004705138",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775020924801_1",
              "name": "productName",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Initial Info Displays"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_INITIAL_INFO_DISPLAYS",
          "id": "1765004773987",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765004773989_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Here are my products (note \"categoryName\" is the Product name): {{$context.$nodes.PRODUCT_BO_NODE_1.$output}} \n\nUse a multiRecordWidget with cols \"Name\". Add action for each row \nwith \"actionText\" as \"Cross-Sell\" and \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\"launchProgramAdvisor\",\"targetProductId=<productId>,targetProductName=<productName>\")\". Limit this to 3 unique products based on categoryName.\n\nMake the title a very brief summary of the results  - for example telling me the top 3 products I should be aware about. Provide a couple sentences going over these products."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_MARKETING_MARKETINGCOMMONDATA",
            "functionName": "getProducts",
            "name": "Get Products based on product"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765093366898"
          },
          "code": "GET_PRODUCTS_BASED_ON_PRODUCT",
          "id": "1765093286677",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775020940884_1",
              "name": "productName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Respond products"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RESPOND_PRODUCTS",
          "id": "1765093366898",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765093366899_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Here are my products (note \"categoryName\" is the Product name): {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRODUCTS_BASED_ON_PRODUCT.$output}} \n\nUse a multiRecordWidget with cols \"Name\". Add action for each row \nwith \"actionText\" as \"Cross-Sell\" and \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\"launchProgramAdvisor\",\"targetProductId=<productId>,targetProductName=<productName>\")\". Limit this to 3 products.\n\nRule: Respond the rows which has unique products or categoryName\n\nMake the title a very brief summary of the results  - for example telling me the top 3 search results. Provide a couple sentences going over these products."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
